: {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1027, "end": 1084, "text": "Trevor chuckled, his blond hair mussed from the exertion."}, "D1S12": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1085, "end": 1108, "text": "\"Getting there, Shinzo."}, "D1S13": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1109, "end": 1172, "text": "But I still can't believe I'm trading in my skates for cleats.\""}, "D1S14": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1173, "end": 1223, "text": "Shinzo grinned, his eyes sparkling with amusement."}, "D1S15": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1224, "end": 1253, "text": "\"You're a natural, my friend."}, "D1S16": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1254, "end": 1268, "text": "And who knows?"}, "D1S17": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1269, "end": 1334, "text": "Maybe one day you'll be leading us to the J.League championship.\""}, "D1S18": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1335, "end": 1442, "text": "Trevor's laughter echoed across the pitch, mingling with the sounds of the city beyond the stadium's walls."}, "D1S19": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1443, "end": 1587, "text": "As the training session drew to a close, Trevor made his way to the locker room, his muscles aching in a way that was both familiar and foreign."}, "D1S20": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1588, "end": 1704, "text": "He couldn't help but think back to the frozen ponds of his childhood, where he had first learned to skate and shoot."}, "D1S21": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1705, "end": 1840, "text": "Who would have thought that the same skills that had earned him a Stanley Cup ring would translate so seamlessly to the football pitch?"}, "D1S22": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1841, "end": 1879, "text": "The evidence, it seemed, was mounting."}, "D1S23": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1880, "end": 2019, "text": "Trevor Daley, the Canadian ice hockey player, was slowly but surely becoming a force to be reckoned with in the world of Japanese football."}, "D2S1": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 0, "end": 16, "text": "**Trevor Daley**"}, "D2S2": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 18, "end": 157, "text": "Trevor Daley is a Canadian professional ice hockey player who currently plays for the **Dallas Stars** of the National Hockey League (NHL)."}, "D2S3": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 158, "end": 183, "text": "**Early Life and Career**"}, "D2S4": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 185, "end": 248, "text": "Daley was born on October 9, 1983, in Toronto, Ontario, Canada."}, "D2S5": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 249, "end": 347, "text": "He was drafted by the Dallas Stars in the second round (43rd overall) of the 2002 NHL Entry Draft."}, "D2S6": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 348, "end": 394, "text": "Daley played junior hockey with the Sault Ste."}, "D2S7": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 395, "end": 568, "text": "Marie Greyhounds of the Ontario Hockey League (OHL) before making his professional debut with the Stars' American Hockey League (AHL) affiliate, the Utah Grizzlies, in 2003."}, "D2S8": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 569, "end": 583, "text": "**NHL Career**"}, "D2S9": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 585, "end": 687, "text": "Daley made his NHL debut with the Dallas Stars on October 21, 2003, against the Columbus Blue Jackets."}, "D2S10": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 688, "end": 769, "text": "Since then, he has played over 1,000 games in the NHL, recording over 300 points."}, "D2S11": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 770, "end": 877, "text": "Daley has been a consistent presence on the Stars' blue line, serving as an alternate captain for the team."}, "D2S12": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 878, "end": 894, "text": "**Current Team**"}, "D2S13": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 896, "end": 975, "text": "As of the 2022-23 NHL season, Trevor Daley is a member of the **Dallas Stars**."}, "D2S14": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 976, "end": 1142, "text": "According to the team's official website and multiple reputable sources, including the NHL's official website and ESPN, Daley is listed as a defenseman for the Stars."}, "D2S15": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1143, "end": 1157, "text": "**References**"}, "D2S16": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1159, "end": 1176, "text": "* \"Trevor Daley\"."}, "D2S17": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1177, "end": 1198, "text": "Hockey-Reference.com."}, "D2S18": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1199, "end": 1220, "text": "Retrieved 2023-02-15."}, "D2S19": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1221, "end": 1238, "text": "* \"Trevor Daley\"."}, "D2S20": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1239, "end": 1247, "text": "NHL.com."}, "D2S21": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1248, "end": 1269, "text": "Retrieved 2023-02-15."}, "D2S22": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1270, "end": 1294, "text": "* \"Dallas Stars Roster\"."}, "D2S23": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1295, "end": 1311, "text": "DallasStars.com."}, "D2S24": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1312, "end": 1333, "text": "Retrieved 2023-02-15."}, "D2S25": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1334, "end": 1351, "text": "* \"Trevor Daley\"."}, "D2S26": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1352, "end": 1361, "text": "ESPN.com."}, "D2S27": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1362, "end": 1383, "text": "Retrieved 2023-02-15."}}, "original_cards": [{"doc_id": "d1", "card_id": "d1:c0", "entity": "Trevor Daley", "scope": "sports team representation", "claim": "Trevor Dale